					"content": "没反应，位置也没变。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						400711512
					],
					"speakerTitle": "枫原万叶"
				},
				{
					"id": 400711512,
					"content": "奇怪，刚才还能进的，现在就把我们拒之门外了。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						400711513
					],
					"speakerTitle": "辛焱"
				},
				{
					"id": 400711513,
					"content": "为什么！存心不让人看完这本书吗！太坏了吧！",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						400711514
					],
					"speakerTitle": "莫娜"
				},
				{
					"id": 400711514,
					"content": "唔…是因为，这本书已经「读到最后」了吧。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						400711515
					],
					"speakerTitle": "枫原万叶"
				},
				{
					"id": 400711515,
					"content": "离开幻境前，我们见到的这本书被翻到了最后一页，我觉得，《圣国的咏唱》可能不止一本。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						400711516
					],
					"speakerTitle": "枫原万叶"
				},
				{
					"id": 400711516,
					"content": "好像什么俗套轻小说的销售套路一样…欲知后事如何，请购买下卷，什么的。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						400711517
					],
					"speakerTitle": "派蒙"
				},
				{
					"id": 400711517,
					"content": "可恶，我一定要看到结局。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						400711518
					],
					"speakerTitle": "莫娜"
				},
				{
					"id": 400711518,
					"content": "噢，噢是的结局，大家都爱看书的结局呢。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						400711519
					],
					"speakerTitle": "阿诺德"
				},
				{
					"id": 400711519,
					"content": "嗯？谁在那边？",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						400711520
					],
					"speakerTitle": "莫娜"
				},
				{
					"id": 400711520,
					"content": "噢，噢天哪，她看见我了，立正立正。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						400711521
					],
					"speakerTitle": "阿诺德"
				},
				{
					"id": 400711521,
					"content": "你是…",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						400711522
					],
					"speakerTitle": "莫娜"
				},
				{
					"id": 400711522,
					"content": "我是「渴望被问路的阿诺德」。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						400711523
					],
					"speakerTitle": "阿诺德"
				},
				{
					"id": 400711523,
					"content": "名字目的性太强了吧！",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						400711524
					],
					"speakerTitle": "派蒙"
				},
				{
					"id": 400711524,
					"content": "阿诺德，我问你…",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						400711525
					],
					"speakerTitle": "莫娜"
				},
				{
					"id": 400711525,
					"content": "是「渴望被问路的阿诺德」，不是阿诺德！",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						400711526
					],
					"speakerTitle": "阿诺德"
				},
				{
					"id": 400711526,
					"content": "渴望被问路的阿诺德，我问你！",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						400711527
					],
					"speakerTitle": "莫娜"
				},
				{
					"id": 400711527,
					"content": "是的女士！",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						400711528
					],
					"speakerTitle": "阿诺德"
				},
				{
					"id": 400711528,
					"content": "《圣国的咏唱》有后续吗？在哪里？",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						400711529
					],
					"speakerTitle": "莫娜"
				},
				{
					"id": 400711529,
					"content": "噢，噢您可真是问对人了。《圣国的咏唱》是幽夜净土的圣典，共有三卷，其余两卷分别藏在王城的两处高地。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						400711530
					],
					"speakerTitle": "阿诺德"
				},
				{
					"id": 400711530,
					"content": "如果你们想找第二卷，得去高塔顶楼。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						400711531
					],
					"speakerTitle": "阿诺德"
				},
				{
					"id": 400711531,
					"content": "高塔，是那边那座吗？",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						400711532
					],
					"speakerTitle": "莫娜"
				},
				{
					"id": 400711532,
					"content": "没错，那就是存放着圣典的塔楼。有条密道能让各位迅速抵达那里，只要你们在那边的山洞里仔细找找。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						400711533
					],
					"speakerTitle": "阿诺德"
				},
				{
					"id": 400711533,
					"content": "好，谢谢你阿诺德。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						400711534
					],
					"speakerTitle": "莫娜"
				},
				{
					"id": 400711534,
					"content": "是「渴望被问路的阿诺德」，不是阿诺德！",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						400711535
					],
					"speakerTitle": "阿诺德"
				},
				{
					"id": 400711535,
					"content": "美丽的女士，您没有其他话要问我了吗？有没有女朋友、每月收入情况什么的…",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						400711536
					],
					"speakerTitle": "阿诺德"
				},
				{
					"id": 400711536,
					"content": "没有，再见！",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						400711537
					],
					"speakerTitle": "莫娜"
				},
				{
					"id": 400711537,
					"content": "别理那只夜鸦了。前面山洞里有密道，能直达塔顶，我们走吧。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						400711538
					],
					"speakerTitle": "莫娜"
				},
				{
					"id": 400711538,
					"content": "噢，噢女士！您当真对我不感兴趣？我可是看您如此美丽才愿意告诉您幽夜净土的秘密！女士！…",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [],
					"speakerTitle": "阿诺德"
				}
			]
		}
	]
}